red. However, the individual chose B. Thus, the reason would predict a preference for A, not B. The information relevant to the decision reason is: A has 67% chance of 0 Euros (unfavorable), B has 66% — so A is more right-skewed by the stated definition. Thus, the reason would prefer A.",
